d cults lurk beneath the mysteries of the tarot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0a8dbad4bbcf5f0daf7ac40a8c02a45f.avif?t=1782178111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras_big/0a8dbad4bbcf5f0daf7ac40a8c02a45f.avif?t=1782178111 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUNT THE DEMONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The demons are hungry. The machines are angry. The cultists are insane. You'll get along wonderfully.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0e5ee9ff597d76e3c9e0c309185960da.poster.avif?t=1782178111\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0e5ee9ff597d76e3c9e0c309185960da.webm?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0e5ee9ff597d76e3c9e0c309185960da.mp4?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle relentless enemies across a dying techno-gothic world where every encounter demands precision, timing and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHALLENGE THE ARCANA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Ah yes... the stars of this little tragedy. Such fascinating creatures. Some seek power. Some seek purpose. Some simply wish to watch everything burn. Hahaha...</i></p><p class=\